# Buff Buddy — environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and paste in your own values. These are read by
# app.config.ts and exposed to the app via Expo's `extra` config.
#
# The coding agent cannot create the Supabase project or generate these keys.
# To get them:
#   1. Create a project at https://supabase.com (free tier is fine).
#   2. Project Settings -> API.
#   3. Copy the "Project URL" and the "anon / public" key below.
#
# The anon key is safe to ship in a client app (it is gated by Row Level
# Security). Never put the service_role key in here.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-ref.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-PUBLIC-KEY
